<title>JAPAN: Nissan says to hire more engineers.</title>
<headline>Nissan says to hire more engineers.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nissan Motor Co Ltd said on Monday it planned to boost the number of engineers it employs.</p>
<p>The company intends to hire 250 new workers for engineering jobs, including research and development, a spokeswoman said. They will start work by about next April.</p>
<p>In addition, about 70 new workers have already been selected for engineering jobs and they will start also work in April, she said.</p>
<p>Due to an economic slump in Japan, the company has for the last few years hired fewer new engineers than formerly.</p>
</text>
